  <h2>Questions to ask any builder before signing a contract</h2>

  <p>You're about to hand someone a significant amount of money and a piece of land. Ask hard questions first. Are they registered? Do they have an ISO certification? Can they show you a finished project you can physically visit? Then go deeper — ask for concrete grade specifications, who signs off on the structural drawings, what the waterproofing specification covers, and what happens if a defect surfaces six months after handover.</p>

  <p>Genuine real estate developers in Lucknow with real processes will answer these without hesitation. The ones who hedge or say "don't worry, we've done hundreds of projects" are the ones to walk away from. Also look for milestone-based payment contracts — the best house builders in Lucknow tie payments to verified construction stages, not vague timelines.</p>

