  <h3>How much does it cost to build a house in Lucknow in 2026?</h3>

  <p>Construction costs in Lucknow range from ₹1,800 to ₹3,500 per sq ft depending on materials and finishing level. A standard 1,200 sq ft 3BHK with proper engineering typically costs ₹22 lakh to ₹35 lakh for the grey structure, with interiors adding ₹8 lakh to ₹20 lakh. Turnkey packages from companies like VP Infra give far better cost predictability than managing multiple contractors yourself.</p>

  <h3>What is the difference between a contractor and a turnkey construction company in Lucknow?</h3>

  <p>A contractor handles one trade — masonry, plumbing, or electrical — and you coordinate the rest. A turnkey construction company in Lucknow manages every phase under one contract and one quality system. This removes coordination gaps between trades and gives you a single point of accountability throughout the project. VP Infra operates exclusively as a turnkey provider.</p>

  <h3>How long does it take to build a house in Lucknow?</h3>

  <p>A G+1 or G+2 residential home takes 12 to 18 months from foundation to handover when managed professionally. Grey structure alone typically runs 6 to 9 months. Delays happen most often when procurement is poorly managed or when multiple contractors work without a central project plan. Milestone-based scheduling, which VP Infra uses on all projects, keeps timelines honest.</p>

